    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Real Property Taxation",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S5342\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to authorize the Congregation Mesifta Beth Shraga to file an\napplication for a real property tax exemption\n\n\n PURPOSE :\nTo authorize Congregation Mesifta Beth Shraga to file an application\nfor a real property tax exemption in the Town of Ramapo.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\nSection 1: Authorizes the assessor of the Town of Ramapo to accept\nfrom the Congregation Mesifta Beth Shraga a retroactive real property\ntax exemption application.\n\nSection 2: Provides for an immediate effective date.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nThe Congregation Mesifta Beth Shraga, was denied an exemption based\nupon the fact that they missed the taxable status date in terms of the\nacquisition of the property.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n2009 - New bill.\n\nNew bill\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nTo be determined.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
