    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S5342A\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\nAn  act  to  authorize  the  Congregation Mesifta Beth Shraga to file an\napplication for a real property tax exemption\n\nPURPOSE:\nTo authorize Congregation Mesifta Beth Shraga to file an application for\na real property tax exemption in the Town of Ramapo.\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\nSection 1: Authorizes the assessor of the Town of Ramapo to accept  from\nthe  Congregation  Mesifta  Beth  Shraga a retroactive real property tax\nexemption application.\n\nSection 2: Provides for an immediate effective date.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe Congregation Mesifta Beth Shraga, was denied an exemption based upon\nthe fact that they missed the taxable status date in terms of the acqui-\nsition of the property.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2009 - New bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTo be determined.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\n\nImmediately.\n\n",
